fficiency scores. We are monitoring the weather closely, but currently, no external flags exist to pull these starters from the lineup. We continue to prioritize stolen base potential and SP-xERA mismatches to gain an edge in the 5x5 standings while we await the return of **Luis Garc\u00eda Jr.**, **Drake Baldwin**, and **Jacob Wilson** to bolster our late-season surge.",
